      ],
      "text": "PilotDeck is an open-source agent operating system organized around a 'WorkSpace' concept, jointly developed by THUNLP, ModelBest, OpenBMB, and AI9Stars, targeting general-purpose multi-task scenarios."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_330c7d586383df4b4d3f15f05bb7ed63bc959977788cd8f00361dc0437651d4a",
