        "slc_c60912cbfe53b8a215d6b05194776c66f33af20f9eeb0c8b5ad5268cfff719b6"
      ],
      "text": "The WorkSpace is the fundamental isolation unit: each project gets its own file system, memory store, and skill set, so parallel work does not interfere and retrieval stays scoped."
    },
