        "slc_945b5559f2211757e856ce789fb9be45747d7a0029d0118a4688fd05d18c6be4"
      ],
      "text": "Memory is white-box and traceable: generation, extraction, storage, and retrieval are visible, entries can be edited or deleted, and a Dream Mode consolidates memory in idle windows with one-click rollback."
    },
