        "slc_4b4ae95c421188c3cc8a3a830112998aa17d3c979c3fe2399b260e6153915d76"
      ],
      "text": "Smart Routing auto-detects task difficulty and sends complex calls to flagship models while simple tasks go to lighter sub-agent models, aiming to reduce token cost."
    },
