        "slc_e42e29b6b5df186d6d478e12aec53651afb7674bf9f83f82f1ab52042248f7ed"
      ],
      "text": "The system supports always-on background execution: after the user signs off, the agent continues discovering tasks, running long-horizon monitors, and writing deliverables as local files with a summary report."
    },
