  "summary": "Selected evidence records: PilotDeck is an open-source agent operating system organized around a 'WorkSpace' concept, jointly developed by THUNLP, ModelBest, OpenBMB, and AI9Stars, targeting general-purpose multi-task scenarios. The WorkSpace is the fundamental isolation unit: each project gets its own file system, memory store, and skill set, so parallel work does not interfere and retrieval stays scoped.",
